; Test 00: start and quit (smoke test, PHASE3-PLAN.md 7.1).
; blitz2 starts TED with the file, version requester of blitz2, TED's
; screen with the source, menu PROJECT/QUIT (no changes: no erase
; requester).  Compared: dump "start", requester sequence, rc.
; @source T t01_int
; @combos R5 C5 Rc Cc
; @est 3
; @nofiles
timeout 10
wait req "OKEE DOKEE"
gad 1
wait screen
dump start
menu 0 9
wait exit
